tei:div.tei:p:
// ༄//
shar chen chos kyi rgyal po mkhan po chen po rin chen mi 'gyur rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po zhes yongs su grags pa nyid lhun grub steng gtsug lag chen por tshogs dbur spyan drangs thob pa'i legs gsol gyi 'bul yig bh+ra ma ra'i mgrin rnga zhes bya ba bzhugs so// ༄༅//
trishāraṇarat+naḥparisaṃghamahāt+m+yamaṃsho3k+ṣarāwalikārobharabeṇahiraṇ+yagar+bho/ mahātaramaṅgenashumas+yamadhudh+wadzas+yāratiḥkaraman+yebidzayan+tubināyakoyaḥ/
